      "response_text": "Synonyms for the word \"cheeky\" include audacious, disrespectful, forward, fresh, impertinent, impudent, insolent, insulting, pert, sassy, saucy, brazen, assuming, barefaced, brash, brassy, confident, gritty, gutsy, immodest, nervy, presumptuous, rude, shameless, smart, and smart-alecky.",
      "role": "training",
      "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:1d02cb371d503037107ffb12cf4a62bfe82bd27a913fea57f9b13db1801fbc5a",
